      "value": "I’m not sure how long it can record for, but I set up a whole bunch (about 7), set fly time to the lowest I could that isn’t 0 (Leaving it on zero from what I’ve found only records for 2 minutes), and it was a 4 minute vid. I stopped it though so I’m not sure if it would’ve kept going. You can set up 50 points, and speed set to 0 with all of those set should give a pretty long video, if not at least most of the event",
