  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Within the new Dolly System for VRC+ subscribers, it is currently not possible to setup a dolly rig, put a loop on it (reverse, linear, repeat --I think) and have OBS use that as the main camera (ala \"play\" in the Dolly system -- its grayed out!) \n\nThis would be a great addition to the system, so people can run the dolly system as a dynamic camera for DJ or Concert events and not have to pause, start recording, stop recording, and record again as MP4's and could instead just stream the footage from the camera itself \"on a loop.\" \n\nDoing this would put a lot of events over the top in production value.",
